    "updated_at": "2022-06-17T00:51:25Z",
    "body": "Which call site are you looking at? Two call sites will catch exceptions and send `messageerror` events instead. The third, inside `structuredClone()`, uses the `?` notation from ECMAScript, which means to propagate the exception.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
